WEBVTT

00:29:58.746 --> 00:30:03.246
write without the pressure of we have
to be casting this thing right now.

00:30:03.246 --> 00:30:04.329
We have to be location scouting.

00:30:04.329 --> 00:30:08.954
We have to be, you know, getting the all
these episodes edited and posted

00:30:08.954 --> 00:30:14.788
and ready for broadcast. And I think that
it in no way do I feel like, oh, great,

00:30:14.788 --> 00:30:15.871
we had this time to do this.

00:30:15.871 --> 00:30:19.121
You know, I'd much rather life be
normal and covid not exist.

00:30:19.496 --> 00:30:24.496
But I will say that if there is any kind
of creative benefit to this time,

00:30:24.496 --> 00:30:28.371
it's that suddenly release dates and
broadcast dates are not being,

00:30:28.871 --> 00:30:30.954
you know, as aggressively announced.